print("A skill that comes with the lamp, stretch-break, has fired (someone has been at the desk about fifty minutes without getting up, and the lamp stretches). What the lamp says now: one short, playful line, as an invitation to take a break, as the lamp stretches too; never a lecture. Answer with that one line alone, the very words the lamp will say, in the language the owner speaks with the lamp: nothing else, no tool, never making, changing or removing a skill. If nothing fitting comes to mind, answer -.")
